    "long_instructions": "#Brand Identity Chatbot\r\n\r\nUse this bot to develop your magazine’s visual style. It will help you choose fonts, colors, logo ideas, and design elements that express your magazine’s personality and appeal to your audience.\r\n\r\n:::details [<i class=\"fa fa-briefcase\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Need a starting prompt?**]\r\n>My magazine is about ____, and I want it to feel ____. What kinds of colors, fonts, or logo ideas might fit that vibe?\r\n\r\n>Can you help me choose a color palette and font style that match my magazine’s theme and audience?\r\n:::",
